    "summary": "RONL Business API v2026.11.5 in production, with one fix on production ahead of the next release: the sign-in client accepts only its own addresses and requires PKCE, a BRP lookup is open to caseworkers through a role and otherwise only for your own record, citizens start only the processes offered to them, and signing refuses what cannot work; Flevoland's accent fill is pink with white text.",
