      "summary": "The contributing pages and the Project Start Architectuur re-checked against all three applications: fifteen workflows in the RONL Business API, lockfile-only promotions that redeploy every application, the VM's Caddy and Postgres pinned, the Linked Data Explorer's API document asking for sign-in, and a new risk for an authentication gap that is chosen to be fixed but not yet built; the ICTU dependency guideline scored 42, 40 and 40, now that lock-file maintenance has merged in all three."
